{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those whom "}, {"text": "تَوَفَّىٰهُمُ", "translation": "take them (in death)"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ", "translation": "the Angels"}, {"text": "ظَالِمِىٓ", "translation": "(while) they (were) wronging"}, {"text": "أَنفُسِهِمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "فِيمَ", "translation": "In what (condition)"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ ۖ", "translation": "were you"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "كُنَّا", "translation": "We were"}, {"text": "مُسْتَضْعَفِينَ", "translation": "oppressed"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "أَلَمْ", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "تَكُنْ", "translation": "was"}, {"text": "أَرْضُ", "translation": "(the) earth"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَٰسِعَةًۭ", "translation": "spacious (enough)"}, {"text": "فَتُهَاجِرُوا۟", "translation": "so that you (could) emigrate"}, {"text": "فِيهَا ۚ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Then those"}, {"text": "مَأْوَىٰهُمْ", "translation": "(will have) their abode"}, {"text": "جَهَنَّمُ ۖ", "translation": "(in) Hell "}, {"text": "وَسَآءَتْ", "translation": "and it is an evil"}, {"text": "مَصِيرًا", "translation": "destination"}], "sahih": "Indeed, those whom the angels take [in death] while wronging themselves1 - [the angels] will say, \"In what [condition] were you?\" They will say, \"We were oppressed in the land.\" They [the angels] will say, \"Was not the earth of Allāh spacious [enough] for you to emigrate therein?\" For those, their refuge is Hell - and evil it is as a destination."}